window.products.push({"id":111199,"name":"K Cup Reusable Coffee Pods - New Stainless Steel 2022 Model - Refillable Coffee Filter Pod for Keurig 2.0 and Backward Compatible With Original Keurig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dULlP2j8L._AC_.jpg","description":"ELITE SERIES REUSABLE K CUPS: Tired of buying cheap and flimsy K cup coffee filters that have different names but are all the same? The Fill N Save ELITE SERIES is made Stainless Steel TOUGH with high industrial quality materials. Durable enough and built to outlast your Keurig Machine! GOLD MESH TECHNOLOGY: Our Reusable K cups use our PATENTED Gold Mesh Technolgy and are carefully lab designed to ensure MAXIMUM flow to allow coffee to flow through and properly heat in the Stainless Steel refillable K Cup so you can drink a more flavorful cup of coffee. NO WEAKNESS: The main weak points of all Plastic Refillable K Cups are the Hinges, Mesh and O Ring. The Elite Series has NO Hinge Which makes the top removable and easy to clean, The Mesh is our PATENTED Gold mesh technology which is designed and tested to allow for a better brew. The O Ring is the highest quality of any O Ring on the market as it has to be thicker in order to fit snug in the Stainless Steel design. EASY TO CLEAN : Just like all our other Fill N Save line of K Cups, they are dishwasher safe and easy to clean. However our Stainless Steel K Cups are even easier to clean as coffee oil residue is easy to wipe off on Stainless Steel simply with water instead of having to wash thoroughly like all of those plastic Refillable K Cups on the market. COMPATIBLE: With almost all Keurig 2.0 and keurig 1.0 machines , NOT COMPATIBLE with Keurig K Supreme","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dULlP2j8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fill N Save","source_asin":"B0B6Y2D91L","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6Y2D91L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6Y2D91L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":111200,"name":"Supplying Demand WX08X10025 IMKR25 25 Feet PEX Refrigerator Water Line with Built-In 1/4 Inch Connections","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3NPz6e+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alternate part numbers include AP3160518, TJ925PEX, 880516, PS311506, WX08X10025B, WX08X10025RB, and WX8X10025. Take care not to overtighten during installation. One piece PEX construction eliminates leaks and corrosion. This line does not degrade like vinyl and is not affected by chlorine. Sterilized during the manufacturing process. An adapter (not included) will be required if 1/4 inch nut connections will not work for your application. It is important to disconnect your appliance from the power and water supply before servicing. Supplying Demand replacement parts are compatible with Major Brands, but you should always verify fitment with your specific model. We have included a video in the product gallery to help you find your model number and information in the description below. SD products come in Supplying Demand packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3NPz6e+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplying Demand","source_asin":"B07FWHYHWR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FWHYHWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FWHYHWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":111201,"name":"WP3362624 Timer Knob Kenmore Washer AP6008101 Part 110.92274100 110.92282100 110.82874120 110.82980120 110.84419810 110.82891120 110.82427620 110.8242","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gg0EVQViS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Washer Timer Knob Wp3362624 3362624 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers WP3362625, AP6008102, 3362625, 3362628, 285633, 285634, 3350970, 3350973, 3353310, PS11741233, WP3362628. 3362624 Timer Knob is compatible with Estate, Kenmore, Roper, Whirlpool appliances. Timer Knob Wp3362624 is a reliable replacement part that can extend the life of a washer. Kenmore Washer Parts Wp3362624 fits hundreds of models and can be easily installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kenmore Washer Knob Wp3362624 will help if your appliance does not start or its timer doesn't advance. It is recommended to unplug the washing machine before attempting any repairs or replacements. 💡 3362624 Washer Timer Knob is made of durable plastic and has a smooth finish for easy grip and handling. Kenmore Part Wp3362624 is black with a chrome center. If the your old knob shows signs of wear, such as cracking or difficulty turning, it may be time to replace it with a new one. Replacement Washer Timer Knob 3362624 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are the washer timer knobs universal? Washer timer knobs are not universal, and compatibility can vary depending on the make and model of the washing machine. Using a timer knob that is not compatible with the washing machine can lead to functional issues, and in some cases, can even cause damage to the appliance. Therefore, it is crucial to verify that the replacement part is compatible with the specific make and model of the washing machine before making a purchase. 💡 How long does the timer knob typically last? The lifespan of the timer knob can vary depending on several factors, including frequency of use, maintenance, and the overall condition of the washer. In general, the timer knob can last for several years with proper care and usage. However, if the knob is subjected to frequent or excessive force, it may become worn or damaged more quickly. It is recommended to clean it regularly with a mild detergent and avoid using abrasive cleaning agents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gg0EVQViS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07J2Z2G7F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J2Z2G7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J2Z2G7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
