window.products.push({"id":111293,"name":"Stove Top Cover for Samsung Gas Burners with 2pcs 21 Inch Stove Gap Covers,Gliuyiza Reusable Stove Guard Stove Top Protector for Gas Range,Non Stick G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xFImYfpWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【What you will get】1 x stove top cover, 2 x stove gap cover. The stove cover can effectively prevent your stove top from oil and dust, and the stove counter gap cover can prevent the accumulation of crumbs and dirt in the gap between your stove and the countertop. 【High temperature resistant material】Our gas stove burner cover is thicker than most gas stove covers, our stove guard is up to 0.5mm thick,which made of high temperature resistant Teflon material that is completely free of PFOA and BPA, and is not easy to be melted or burned. 【Easy to Clean】This stove cover for gas burners is very easy to clean, you only need to gently rinse the stove protector which is covered with dust and oil under running water to remove the dirt, if the dirt is really serious, you can clean it with soap or soapy water. 【Easy to install and lay flat】The gas stove liners is very easy to install,we use it in roll packaging, so there are almost no folds and can lay flat on top of the gas stove well, it fits perfectly with your gas range stove top. 【Warning and After-sale Service】We promise that the stove liners will fit for most Samsung gas stove range, but you should check the size carefully before buying. If the size is not suitable or you have any dissatisfaction with the product, please contact me in time, we will arrange return and refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xFImYfpWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gliuyiza","source_asin":"B0BF59XZS6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF59XZS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF59XZS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":111294,"name":"Amana 4.4 cu. ft. Gas Range, AGR4433XDW, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TzBOh2VsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Product Description Amana 4.4 cu. ft. Gas Range This gas range helps you rustle up your favorite food with ease. The Easy Touch Electronic Oven Controls make setting the ideal bake time and temperature a piece of cake. Plus, the extra-large oven window lets you see what's cooking without opening the door. Product Features Additional Features 4.4 cu. ft. Capacity There's plenty of room for your favorite dishes with this 4.4 cu. ft. capacity range. Extra-Large Oven Window Feast your eyes on this. An extra-large window helps you keep track of dinner without having to open the door. Temp Assure Cooking System Ensures a consistent oven temperature with a preheat cycle and temperature monitoring for both baking and broiling. Spillsaver Upswept Cooktop Design Sometimes you can't avoid a little mess. A smooth, seamless surface with raised edges contains spills for easy cleanup. Easy Touch Electronic Oven Controls It's touch and go! Setting the bake time and temperature is a snap with these easy-to-use electronic controls. Interior Oven Light Turn this on to shine a spotlight on your food as it cooks, making it easier for you to watch the progress. Burner Type(3) 9,500 BTU and (1) 11,500 BTU sealed burners with wire steel burner grates. Burner Type (3) 9,500 BTU and (1) 11,500 BTU sealed burners with wire steel burner grates. Porcelain-Steel Cooking Surface It's OK to spill the beans. They'll clean up easily with a smooth porcelain steel cooking surface. Porcelain-Steel Cooking Surface It's OK to spill the beans. They'll clean up easily with a smooth porcelain steel cooking surface. Towel Bar Door Handle Spills can strike at any time--be ready to strike back with your dish towel hanging on the oven door, ready for action. Towel Bar Door Handle Spills can strike at any time--be ready to strike back with your dish towel hanging on the oven door, ready for action. Electronic Clock with TimeNot only does it indicate time, it provides a timer so you can keep track of what you're cooking. Electronic Clock with Time Not only does it indicate time, it provides a timer so you can keep track of what you're cooking. LP Conversion Kit All Amana gas ranges are LP convertible and include an LP conversion kit for convenience. LP Conversion Kit All Amana gas ranges are LP convertible and include an LP conversion kit for convenience. Parts & Accessories Gas Hook-Up Kit This kit includes everything you'll need to safely install your gas range—stainless gas connector, fitting, pipe thread sealant and a leak test solution. Gas Grate & Grill Cleaner Clean grease, grime and food stains off your grill—indoors or out. This easy-to-use cleaner works great on porcelain, cast iron, chrome or glass surfaces. It also removes mineral deposits, rust lime scale and soap scum, so use it all around the house. Porcelain-Coated Broiler Pan This broiler pan features a porcelain coating that helps it drain easily. Smoke and splattering are minimized, making cleanup easy. Rust Removing Powder Cleaner This heavy-duty cleanser works with mild abrasives to clean hard surfaces and appliances. Use on stainless steel, porcelain, tile, fiberglass sinks and tubs, fixtures and copper pans. Before You Buy Do you feel like you're running a marathon when you cook? Is your range on one side of the kitchen while your microwave is across the room? A Clever Combo cooking center can cut down on all that running. Pair your range with an over-the-range microwave to create a single unit that simply puts it all in one place. How often do you like to check on food as it's baking? Do you open the oven door? All Amana gas ranges with an oven window feature an extra-large one so it's easy to check the progress of your dishes without opening the door. Dimensions Key Considerations Tip #1 Measure the space for a new dishwasher as well as any doorways or hallways the appliances must fit through. Tip #2 Before beginning installation, gather all tools and parts required to make the process go quicker. Tip #3 A 120 volt, 60 Hz, AC only, 15-amp fueled electrical circuit is required. A time-delay fuse or circuit breaker is recommended. See electrical requirements in the installation instructions for more details. Warranty Information Limited One Year Warranty - Parts and Labor - For one (1) year from the original retail purchase date, any part that fails in normal home use will be repaired or replaced free of charge. Refer to amana.com or the individual product Use and Care Guide for warranty details. From the Manufacturer This gas range helps you rustle up your favorite food with ease. The Easy Touch Electronic Oven Controls make setting the ideal bake time and temperature a piece of cake. Plus, the extra-large oven window lets you see what�s cooking without opening the door.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TzBOh2VsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMANA","source_asin":"B003FW7AUI","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FW7AUI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FW7AUI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
