window.products.push({"id":111359,"name":"COSTWAY 3-in-1 Water Dispenser with Ice Maker, Countertop Top-Loading Hot and Cold Water Cooler Machine for Home, Safety Lock, Hold 3-5 Gallon Bottle,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GC846GJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦➕🧊 [Tri-Mode Ice Water Dispenser] This water dispenser with ice maker provides instant access to hot water(≥ 194°F), ice cubes and cold waters (≦ 46.4°F), covering all your daily drinking needs. The built-in ice maker produces 12 cubes of bullet shaped ice cubes within a short amount of 6 mins. Compact size fits your countertop. 💦➕🧊 [2 Ways to Refill] Our water cooler dispenser is equipped with a water jug core, on which you can load 3-5 gallons of barreled water for unattended and consistent water supply. Or you can refill the water tank with drinkable water manually through the water jug core. Besides, there is a cover for the water core to keep it clean. 💦➕🧊 [Safety Child Lock] Featuring a safety lock, this Top-Loading 3-in-1 hot and cold water dispenser prevents accidental dispensing of hot water, so the entire family can use it worry-free. And it falls in line with the ETL certification standard, which reassures you and your family of safety using the environment. The stainless steel material makes the ice maker durable. 💦➕🧊 [Easy to operate] Coming with intuitive control panels and all sorts of indicating lights, this water cooler takes no experts to use. The indicators include the water shortage light and ice full light to remind you of adding the water or removing the ice to save energy. And the ice maker will stop working if the above situation happens. 💦➕🧊 [Removable Drip Tray] To avoid water spillage, this water dispenser with ice maker boasts a drip tray. And you can also pour out water on it. The drip tray is designed removable to provide you with an easy way of cleaning. And under the ice spout, there is a night light which will light up when dispensing ice for easy viewing.​","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GC846GJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0B58VF1TB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B58VF1TB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B58VF1TB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
