window.products.push({"id":111997,"name":"4 Pack 131763310 Washer Door Striker Replacement Part by Beaquicy - Fit for Frigidaire Kenmore Crosley Washing Machine - Replaces 131763300 AP3580441 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414SzIgpC4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【𝟒 𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲 𝟏𝟑𝟏𝟕𝟔𝟑𝟑𝟏𝟎 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑫𝑶𝑶𝑬 𝑺𝑻𝑹𝑰𝑲𝑬𝑹】: The Washer Door Striker 131763310 is for front load washers. It is used to lock the washing machine door so that the door will not open during the operation of the washing machine. The door striker is located on the body of the washing machine and locks the door in place. When the latch is correct, it signals to your washing machine that the door is locked and the cycle can begin. ➤If striker is broken, the washer will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the striker need to be replaced in time: Door won't close or open. Won’t start. Door latch failure. Won’t fill with water. 【𝑭𝑰𝑻 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑩𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑫𝑺】: The Washer Door Striker 131763310 can fits for Frigi-daire, Ken-more, Crosley, Gi-bson washer. Replaces: 131763300, 134456600, 1032664, AP3580441, PS890617, EAP890617. ➤131763310 Door Striker Compatible: LTF2140FS1, ATF6000ES0, ATF6000FS1, ATF6000FS2, ATFB6000ES0, BLTF2940ES3, GLTF2070CS0, GLTR1670AS1, 970L48422E0, 41740412701, 41724182300, 41724182301, 41727182700, 41727182701, 41727182702, 41727182703, 41727182704, 41729042992, 41729052991, 41740032990, 41740042990, 41740052990, 41740142000, 41740412700, 41740412701, 9703871220, 9703880220, BTF1240FS1, BTF2140ES0, CFW2000FW2, CFW4000FW0, CFW4000FW1, CFW4500KW0, CFW2000FW1, CLCE900FW0, CLCE900FW2, etc. 【𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】: The 131763310 washing machine door striker is made of durable, high quality ABS PLASTIC materials with high abrasion resistance design for long-lasting durability. It is worth noting that door striker can wear out or even break in multiple openings and closings. If the striker breaks, the washer won’t work properly. ➤Package includes 4 x 131763310 washing machine door striker. The color of this door striker is white. The 131763310 door striker measures 2.6 inches long x 0.6 inches wide x 1.3 inches high. 【𝟔𝟎 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: The 131763310 Washer Door Striker support 60 days return and exchange. ➤The 131763310 Door Striker has thickened the walls of the striker to ensure accurate dimensions, making the striker more resistant to wear and tear and less likely to break and wear out due to repeated opening and closing of the washing machine door. The Striker is available in packs of four to meet daily replacement needs and is more cost effective than buying individually. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】: The installation of 131763310 Door Striker is simple. Before making repairs, disconnect the power and water supply and wear work gloves. You need a screwdriver. Find the door striker that needs to be replaced and use the screwdriver to remove the screws that hold it in place. Take out the new part and secure it, making sure the door striker will not come loose. The replacement is complete. You can save money on replacing your washer or hiring a repairman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414SzIgpC4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0832PY7GD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-111997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0832PY7GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0832PY7GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
